  "subtitle": "Rich, deeply flavoured braise with allspice and Worcestershire",
  "excerpt": "This braise draws on British and Caribbean cooking traditions, using beef shin slow-cooked until it falls apart in a deep, fragrant sauce. Allspice and Worcestershire give it a warmth that sets it apart from a standard beef stew. It improves overnight and freezes well.",
