        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Beef shin needs a full 2.5 to 3 hours over very low heat to break down its collagen into the sauce. Do not rush the cook by raising the heat or the meat will tighten rather than soften." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What you need" }]
      },
